  "description": "Han Ba-Ram and Lim Han-Tae first met the day Ba-Ram quit his guitar academy after an incident with the teacher. Now, six years later, the two are close, but Ba-Ram secretly has feelings for his best friend. Ba-Ram has tried to move on from the past and his crush, but when their former guitar teacher plays Ba-Ram's song on TV and claims it's his, he is forced to confront his past and tell Han-Tae what really happened that day. Will Ba-Ram finally stand up for himself... and confess his crush on Han-Tae?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
